## Architecture (target)

```
                    ┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
                    │         api.remifi.xyz (agent)          │
                    │  intent · quotes · contacts · history   │
                    │  NO user private keys · NO user signing │
                    └───────────────┬─────────────────────────┘
                                    │
        ┌───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┐
        │                           │                           │
   remifi.xyz                   Telegram                    WhatsApp
   Thirdweb wallet              senderPhone                 senderPhone
   user signs txs               links to same userId        links to same userId
        │                           │                           │
        └───────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────┘
                                    │
                              Celo + RemifiVault
                         (user wallet → vault → recipient wallet)
```

| Layer | Role |
|-------|------|
| **Thirdweb (web)** | User auth (phone / email / social), embedded wallet, sign swap + transfer or vault deposit |
| **Agent API** | Parse intent, resolve contacts, Mento quotes, build unsigned tx payload or escrow params, store per-user data |
| **RemifiVault** | Lock funds for phone-only recipients; claim with secret link + recipient wallet |
| **Twilio** | SMS/WhatsApp claim link to recipient (optional; link can also be shared by sender) |
| **Telegram bot** | Thin client; passes `senderPhone` / `telegramUserId` so agent uses **that user's** contacts and wallet |

