## Signing model migration

| Phase | Sender signs | Recipient | Status |
|-------|--------------|-----------|--------|
| **Now (legacy)** | Agent (`AGENT_PRIVATE_KEY`) | Wallet or escrow from agent deposit | Still available via `POST /api/transfer` without `senderWallet` |
| **Phase 1** | User (Thirdweb) for wallet sends | Unchanged | **Shipped** — `prepare` / `confirm`, Pay confirm page, PayChat user path |
| **Phase 2** | User deposits to vault for phone recipients | Claim via link + Thirdweb + phone verify | **Partial** — calldata in prepare; vault not deployed |
| **Phase 3** | Deprecate agent-funded sends except demos | Full phone-first remittance | Not started |

Keep `AGENT_PRIVATE_KEY` only for: server health checks, MCP demos, scheduled jobs that users explicitly authorize, or subsidized gas — not routine user sends.

